tinykepler is independently implemented from universal-variable two-body equations.
No AGPL source was translated or included. Frozen expected states were generated
with SciPy 1.18.1 DOP853 numerical integration (BSD licensed), using no tinykepler
outputs to generate reference states. The raw oracle output and generator are in
ignored .validation/tinykepler/. Reference: https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.integrate.solve_ivp.html
